{
 "_about": [
  "How sets are organized in the app. Display only: mini keys and saved collections never change here.",
  "Release pages (Core Sets) show their booster checklist plus their promos. Premium/boxed minis listed on a",
  "release page are shown in their own product set instead, nested under the release in the sidebar.",
  "Automatic rules (scripts/organize.py): a release-page listing that is Unique/Promo or unnumbered and has the",
  "same picture as a listing outside Core Sets is the same mini. If that other listing is in Promos it is a promo",
  "of the release; otherwise it belongs to that product set. Rarity Promo means promo. Everything else is booster.",
  "promo: release-page listings that are promos (case incentives, collector's-box exclusives).",
  "booster: release-page listings forced onto the booster checklist.",
  "products: product sets made from release-page listings that MinisGallery has no separate page for.",
  "parents: release a product set belongs to, when the automatic rules can't tell.",
  "same: listings that are one physical mini (identical picture file at a different address).",
  "separate: listings with the same picture address that are different minis."
 ],
